<title>LEBANON: Lebanon's Banque Audi reports profits up.</title>
<headline>Lebanon's Banque Audi reports profits up.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's Banque Audi reported on Wednesday that net profits rose 18.7 percent to 17.02 billion pounds ($11.05 million) in the first half of 1997 over the same period of 1996.</p>
<p>The bank also said its assets grew 31.7 percent during the period to 3,081.24 billion Lebanese pounds, mainly due to a rise in customer deposits.</p>
</text>
